Query the names of all the Japanese cities in the CITY table. The COUNTRYCODE for Japan is JPN.

                CITY
------------------------------------
        FIELD    |     TYPE
------------------------------------
        ID       |    NUMBER
------------------------------------
        NAME     |     VARCHAR2(17)
------------------------------------
  COUNTRYCODE    |    VARCHAR2(3)
------------------------------------
      DISTRICT   |   VARCHAR2(20)
------------------------------------
    POPULATION   |      NUMBER
------------------------------------

Solution:

SELECT NAME
FROM CITY
WHERE COUNTRYCODE = 'JPN';
